{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n \n \n こんばんは\n \n \n 今日も１日お疲れ様です。\n \n \n W-KEYAKI FESの時の\n メンバーとの写真で載せきれなかった\n お写真たちを。📷\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0MN9CFRQKEM5WGYPXKFM48","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0MNAD6DJTMQ27QSX08N8A5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0MNBFHDNCS8RWMN045X77D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0MNCHK7VYF5AWVE940SCQ5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0MNDKYV22A4BJ5BW2D2VM4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0MNENF3QPZ2Y6JFHH0JBS6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0MNFPW5B5772ZZ3WD37W91","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 先に23歳になっちゃって。\n すぐ追いつくんだから。\n \n \n おめでとう‪‪🎂\n \n \n \n -\n \n \n いつの日かの帰り道で見た夕空が\n 凄く綺麗だったので、\n 皆さんにもおすそわけ‪‪☺︎‬\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0MNGQWNBS71JP4978PAF1F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0MNHT06RGQ2JMSBA94ZMSJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n ５分くらいで、このような空に。\n \n \n 本当に一瞬だったな、\n \n \n 近くにあったベンチに座って\n 思わず見ちゃったくらい綺麗でした‪‪☺︎‬\n \n \n 凄く癒されました～～\n \n \n では。\n \n \n \n \n 本日の音楽。\n \n \n マルシィさん / プラネタリウム\n \n \n まだこの曲に出会ったばかりなのに\n もう、大好きです。\n \n \n みい。             "}],"source":"archive"}